    "title": "GSP Release Details About Tuesdays Accident Involving A White County School Bus - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Dean Dyer ,\n1 days ago (Cleveland)- The Georgia State Patrol has released the preliminary findings about a two-vehicle accident in White County Tuesday involving a White County School bus. Department of Public Safety spokesperson Franka Young said a trooper from GSP Post 6 in Gainesville investigated the accident. The accident happened at approximately 3:40 p.m.... Read full article\n2",
